            <ArticleTitle>Conversion reaction in an 82-year-old man.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>368-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Conversion reactions are considered rare in the elderly. The author offers a case report of an 82-year-old man with a conversion pain syndrome and points out that conversion reactions may occur at any age and among all personality styles.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
